data: {"id": "0527b3274e6443e3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1607", "run_id": "0527b3274e6443e3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "第一轮数据采集已完成。基于真实工具结果，分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n- **实体确认**: Pod `aiops-case-v16/workload` (UID: `12605456-2339-4da9-9d4d-5523d1196b72`)，调度在 `node2` (IP: `10.2.0.50`)，Pod IP `172.16.104.33`。\n- **当前状态**: **Running**。\n- **关键事实**: 虽然 Pod 进程正在运行（Logs 显示 `listening on 18080`，PromQL 显示 Phase=1），但 **Readiness Probe 持续失败**。\n\n### 2. 支持候选原因的证据 (NotReady 根因)\n- **Readiness Probe 失败**: `kubectl_describe` 明确显示：\n  ```text\n  Warning  Unhealthy 3m46s (x256 over 23m) kubelet Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789387843677, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

