data: {"id": "0527b3274e6443e3-final", "run_id": "0527b3274e6443e3", "seq": 1612, "ts_ms": 1789387862635, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Pod aiops-case-v16/workload 状态为 NotReady（Readiness Probe 持续失败） |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Unhealthy ... Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused` [fact-4ebb82f80ee1] | 证明 kubelet 向 Pod IP 172.16.104.33 的 18081 端口发起连接时被拒绝 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Pod 监听 IP：`172.16.104.33/32` [fact-58965b0c1a80, fact-a0909d53e018] | 确认异常事件中的目标 IP 与 Pod 实际分配 IP 一致，排除网络隔离问题 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | `listening on 18080` [fact-5dd54cd9b22b] | 显示应用实际在 18080 端口进行监听，证实存在端口配置错位 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 状态：`Running`，重启次数：`0` [fact-93bf3f6f7744, fact-11b783223aaf] | 排除容器崩溃或 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的启动失败，确认进程存活 |\n\n**证据分析**\nKubernetes 事件与日志形成了闭环证据：事件明确指向 18081 端口连接失败，而日志显示应用仅在 18080 端口监听。Pod 处于 Running 状态且无重启，排除了应用自身异常。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nProbe 配置端口 (18081) 与容器实际监听端口 (18080) 不匹配 → Kubelet 向 18081 发起 HTTP 连接探测 → 目标端口无进程监听，连接被拒绝 (connection refused) → Readiness 探针连续失败，Pod 标记为 NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **探针端口配置错误**。\n\n证据表明，应用已在 **18080** 端口启动并监听，而 Kubernetes Readiness Probe 被配置为探测 **18081** 端口。由于 18081 端口未监听，kubelet 获取到 `connection refused` 错误，导致探针持续失败，进而将 Pod 状态更新为 NotReady。\n\n*   直接证据：日志显示监听端口为 18080（见证据 #3），K8s 事件显示探测目标端口为 18081 并被拒绝（见证据 #1）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v16/workload: 41.7s (Evidence 32.7s, RCA 8.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v16/workload**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 74.344, "metrics": {"run_id": "0527b3274e6443e3", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 74.33756017684937, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 74337.56017684937, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 67464.43772315979, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 22933.07900428772, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6472.63503074646}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22745.04780769348, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 41713.69123458862, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9858.252763748169, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

